{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-04-21 08:28:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY TO DONATE, PLANT 700 TREES ACROSS MAHONING VALLEY TO CELEBRATE EARTH AND ARBOR DAYS', 'text': "AKRON, OHIO , APRIL 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) WILL DONATE 300 TREES TO MILL CREEK METROPARKS IN MAHONING COUNTY, OHIO, TO CELEBRATE EARTH AND ARBOR DAYS. A MIXED VARIETY OF HARDWOOD TREES WILL BE PLANTED ON MONDAY, APRIL 25, BY EMPLOYEES OF FIRSTENERGY AND ITS OHIO EDISON ELECTRIC COMPANY THROUGHOUT THE METROPARKS' 402-ACRE FARM IN CANFIELD."}